  "text": "### Customer Data Security  \n**Personal Information:**\n- Never discuss on phone where customers can hear\n- Don't leave documents on desk\n- File customer documents in locked cabinet\n- Shred documents when no longer needed  \n**System Access:**\n- Log out when leaving desk\n- Never share passwords\n- Report suspicious activity immediately\n- Lock computer when absent  \n---",
